  "statusReason": "The override in data/overrides/rewards-guardian.json models one search, main/rare/pet separation, evolving pouch ownership with prepacked essence, one-time diary/needle, and quest talisman substitutions. Rune quantities use the published full-level ranges: the below-required-Runecraft-level reduction remains unmodeled; the source comment omits complete bounds and rounding. The rare table is a mutually exclusive pool preserving stated marginal rates, but within-rare co-occurrence is not explicitly confirmed. Intricate pouches are awarded unopened. See docs/bosses/rewards-guardian.md and apps/ingest/test/rewards-guardian.test.ts.",
